# GRUB SHIFT: a grown sourmite spoils every pod next to it, so no pod blast
# can reach it, but other blasts can. When it dies the sour pods around it
# turn back into fizz pods: a shot that feeds a sour pod and kills the
# sourmite leaves one more fizz pod there, and no blast.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat bug 3 2 4 1
cheat pods 4 2 1
cheat chip 6 24
cheat use 6 5 4
expect pods_at54 == 1
expect sour_at42 == 1
expect pods_at42 == 0
cheat tilly 2 2
cheat use 5 4 2
expect kills == 1
expect sour_at42 == 0
expect pods_at42 == 2
expect status == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat bug 3 2 4 1
cheat bug 4 2 1 3
cheat chip 3 22
cheat use 3 4 2
expect kills == 2
expect bug_at32 == 0
